OL,3,GNEWSAFears over plans for battery site
OL,4,Anear school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of parents whose children
OL,7,Fattend a rural primary school have said
OL,8,Fthey are concerned by proposals to
OL,9,Fbuild a battery storage plant nearby.
OL,11,FThese sites, also known as battery
OL,12,Fenergy storage systems (BESS), hold
OL,13,Fenergy generated from wind or solar and
OL,14,Frelease it when needed, but there are
OL,15,Fconcerns about fire safety due to the
OL,16,Flithium used in the batteries.
OL,18,FElgin Energy's plans for the site would
OL,19,Fput it less than one kilometre from St
OL,20,FLucia's Primary School and Nursery in
OL,21,FUpton Magna, Shropshire.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
