OL,4,Anear school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm has said it has "taken on
OL,7,Fboard guidance from Shropshire Fire and
OL,8,FRescue Service and the National Fire
OL,9,FChiefs Council" when designing the
OL,10,Fsite.
